
PROJECT TITLE:
ENTERPRISE MULTI-BRANCH RETAIL POS AND INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

========================================================
1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
========================================================

Build a complete, professional, enterprise-grade, cloud-based Multi-Branch Retail Point of Sale (POS) and Inventory Management System.

The application must support multiple retail branches operating under one centralized organization.

Each branch must maintain its own:
- Sales records.
- Inventory records.
- Purchases.
- Expenses.
- Customers, where branch-specific.
- Cashier transactions.
- Cash register sessions.
- Stock movements.
- Branch reports.
- Staff activities.

The Head Office Administrator must have centralized control over all branches.

The system must provide separate registration, authentication, dashboards, roles and permissions for administrators, branch administrators, supervisors and cashiers.

The application must be fully functional, responsive, secure, scalable and ready for eventual production deployment.

Do not build only a static UI prototype. All application features must connect to the backend and Firebase database.

