3. APPLICATION ARCHITECTURE
========================================================

Build a centralized multi-tenant and multi-branch application.

The application must have:

1. Central Head Office Administration.
2. Multiple retail branches.
3. Independent branch operations.
4. Centralized product catalogue.
5. Branch-specific inventory.
